{
  "slug": "preguntas",
  "number": 11,
  "part": 3,
  "title": "Asking questions",
  "tagline": "Three registers, inversion and quel, quelle, quels, quelles.",
  "goal": "Ask questions in an informal, neutral and formal register, use every question word and make quel agree.",
  "minutes": 9,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "registros",
      "title": "Three ways to ask",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "French has no «do» for questions. Instead there are three options:"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "head": [
            "Register",
            "How",
            "Example"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "**Informal** (conversation)",
              "Raise your voice at the end",
              "*Tu viens ?*"
            ],
            [
              "**Neutral** (always works)",
              "*est-ce que* + normal sentence",
              "*Est-ce que tu viens ?*"
            ],
            [
              "**Formal** (writing, formal situations)",
              "Swap verb and subject",
              "*Viens-tu ?*"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "tip",
          "text": "*est-ce que* (literally «is it that») turns any sentence into a question without changing the word order. Before a vowel it becomes *est-ce qu'*: *Est-ce qu'il vient ?*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "inversion",
      "title": "Inversion and the -t-",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In inversion, the verb and the pronoun swap places and are joined by a **hyphen**, a bit like English «are you…?»:"
        },
        {
          "type": "examples",
          "items": [
            {
              "fr": "Parlez-vous français ?",
              "tr": "Do you speak French?"
            },
            {
              "fr": "As-tu faim ?",
              "tr": "Are you hungry?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "warning",
          "text": "If the verb ends in a vowel and the pronoun is *il, elle* or *on*, a **-t-** is slipped in to avoid the clash: *A-t-il un chien ? · Parle-t-elle anglais ? · Va-t-on au parc ?*"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Same logic as *cet* [[3]] and *mon amie* [[8]]."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "interrogativos",
      "title": "Question words",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "table",
          "head": [
            "French",
            "English",
            "Example"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "*qui*",
              "who",
              "*Qui est-ce ?*"
            ],
            [
              "*que / qu'est-ce que*",
              "what",
              "*Qu'est-ce que tu fais ?*"
            ],
            [
              "*quoi*",
              "what (informal, at the end)",
              "*Tu fais quoi ?*"
            ],
            [
              "*où*",
              "where",
              "*Où habites-tu ?*"
            ],
            [
              "*quand*",
              "when",
              "*Quand est-ce que tu pars ?*"
            ],
            [
              "*comment*",
              "how",
              "*Comment tu t'appelles ?*"
            ],
            [
              "*pourquoi*",
              "why",
              "*Pourquoi tu ris ?* → *Parce que…* (because)"
            ],
            [
              "*combien*",
              "how much, how many",
              "*Combien ça coûte ?*"
            ],
            [
              "*quel / quelle…*",
              "which, what",
              "*Quel âge as-tu ?*"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "They combine with all three registers: *Où tu habites ?* · *Où est-ce que tu habites ?* · *Où habites-tu ?*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "quel",
      "title": "Quel, quelle, quels, quelles",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*quel* is an adjective, so it agrees with the noun [[2]]. All four forms **sound the same**."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "head": [
            "",
            "Singular",
            "Plural"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Masculine",
              "*quel livre ?*",
              "*quels livres ?*"
            ],
            [
              "Feminine",
              "*quelle couleur ?*",
              "*quelles couleurs ?*"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "note",
          "text": "*quel* is also used in exclamations, like «what a…!»: *Quelle surprise !* (What a surprise!) · *Quel beau temps !* (What lovely weather!)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "registro",
      "title": "Change the register",
      "instructions": "Write the question with est-ce que.",
      "kind": "type",
      "speak": "answer",
      "items": [
        {
          "prompt": "Tu aimes le chocolat ?",
          "answer": "Est-ce que tu aimes le chocolat ?"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "Il parle français ?",
          "answer": "Est-ce qu'il parle français ?"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "Vous habitez à Paris ?",
          "answer": "Est-ce que vous habitez à Paris ?"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "Elle a un chat ?",
          "answer": "Est-ce qu'elle a un chat ?"
        }
      ],
      "section": "registros"
    },
    {
      "id": "inversion",
      "title": "With inversion",
      "instructions": "Write the question with inversion. Don't forget the -t- when it's needed.",
      "kind": "type",
      "speak": "answer",
      "items": [
        {
          "prompt": "Tu aimes le chocolat ?",
          "answer": "Aimes-tu le chocolat ?"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "Il parle français ?",
          "answer": "Parle-t-il français ?"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "Vous habitez à Paris ?",
          "answer": "Habitez-vous à Paris ?"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "Elle a un chat ?",
          "answer": "A-t-elle un chat ?"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "On va au parc ?",
          "answer": "Va-t-on au parc ?"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "Ils sont prêts ?",
          "answer": "Sont-ils prêts ?"
        }
      ],
      "section": "inversion"
    },
    {
      "id": "pregunta",
      "title": "What's the question?",
      "instructions": "Choose the question that matches the answer.",
      "kind": "choice",
